  m_Name: BattleScreenOverview
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hasSkipButton: 0
  textBoxes:
  - message: Here you can see what the target is and how tough it'll be. You can
      also look over what troops you have stationed in the contintent. Don't fight
      it yet though!
    buttonText: Why not?
  - message: You shouldn't be fighting anything with less than 5 troops. You'll lose
      the lives of your units and waste time that way. You'll have to move troops
      from neighboring continents over.
    buttonText: How?
  - message: Click on one of the black dots on a neighboring contintent.
    buttonText: 
